{"title": "Shadow Ambush", "pageid": 18556, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadow_Ambush", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Necrotic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp/300px-Generic_Necrotic.webp, /w/images/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp/300px-Generic_Necrotic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Shadow Ambush</b> is a passive feature that allows this creature to deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">4d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage when attacking from the shadows.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">4d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage when attacking from the shadows. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Afara\" title=\"Afara\">Afara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Baxta\" title=\"Baxta\">Baxta</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bluenail\" title=\"Bluenail\">Bluenail</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dohna\" title=\"Dohna\">Dohna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dollay\" title=\"Dollay\">Dollay</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fredrichk\" title=\"Fredrichk\">Fredrichk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Garrigan\" title=\"Garrigan\">Garrigan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gloommask\" title=\"Gloommask\">Gloommask</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greymask\" title=\"Greymask\">Greymask</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gydd\" title=\"Gydd\">Gydd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hendly\" title=\"Hendly\">Hendly</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Humboldt\" title=\"Humboldt\">Humboldt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hyrald\" title=\"Hyrald\">Hyrald</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Imwise\" title=\"Imwise\">Imwise</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lamona\" title=\"Lamona\">Lamona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Monteith\" title=\"Monteith\">Monteith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morann\" title=\"Morann\">Morann</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nightmist\" title=\"Nightmist\">Nightmist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Owltalon\" title=\"Owltalon\">Owltalon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Novice\" title=\"Sharran Novice\">Sharran Novice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Sentry\" title=\"Sharran Sentry\">Sharran Sentry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tylda\" title=\"Tylda\">Tylda</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Uttermask\" title=\"Uttermask\">Uttermask</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wilbur\" title=\"Wilbur\">Wilbur</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Deals +4d8 <a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\">necrotic</a> damage when attacking from shadows.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214451\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1028/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7294/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4288/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1396/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643648/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.012      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   44.012      1 -total\n 41.97%   18.473      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 36.40%   16.019      1 Template:PageSeo\n 30.57%   13.453      2 Template:DamageText\n 27.00%   11.885      2 Template:Damage_type\n 26.19%   11.5